{
  "about": "What the gateway takes in the text fields of an answer (SEC-1). sync-push/handler.ts (DATA) and tutor-turn/handler.ts (OPTION) are tested equal to these in Deno; the app's constants (app/lib/play/response_code.dart) and the fake server of the sync tests read them in Dart. The examples are the longest codes the templates write; the Deno test pushes each one through the real sync-push.",
  "attempt_fields": {
